#: ../../introduction-chapter.rst:10
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../introduction.rst:3
msgid ""
"|vendor_name| Origin software development kit (SDK) allows developers to "
"monetize, monitor, and protect Android applications utilizing the |"
"vendor_name| Origin Platform. Origin SDK is composed of modules which "
"may be integrated conditionally, depending on capabilities required by "
"an application."
msgstr ""
"|vendor_name| Origin 软件开发工具包（SDK）使开发者能够基于 |vendor_name| "
"Origin 平台实现 Android 应用的变现、监控和安全防护。Origin SDK 由多个模块组成，"
"开发者可根据应用所需功能进行按需集成。"

#: ../../introduction.rst:9
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能特性"

#: ../../introduction.rst:11
msgid "Supports Android 4.4 (API level 19) and above."
msgstr "支持 Android 4.4（API Level 19）及以上版本。"

#: ../../introduction.rst:12
msgid ""
"Supports mobile, smart TV, and other smart devices on which Android can "
"be deployed."
msgstr "支持运行 Android 系统的移动设备、智能电视以及其他智能设备。"

#: ../../introduction.rst:13
msgid ""
"No dependencies outside of core Android APIs, :code:`androidx-"
"core:core`, and :code:`com.google.guava:listenablefuture`."
msgstr ""
"除 Android 核心 API、:code:`androidx-core:core` "
"以及 :code:`com.google.guava:listenablefuture` 外，不依赖任何其他外部库。"

#: ../../introduction.rst:15
msgid "Extremely lightweight, with production AARs of a few hundred KB."
msgstr "极其轻量，发布的 AAR版本 文件大小仅为数百KB。"
